8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">toki</span><span begin="03:29.838" end="03:30.213" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">o</span><span begin="03:30.213" end="03:30.899" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">koe</span><span begin="03:30.899" end="03:34.924" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="03:35.537" end="03:35.933" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">My</span><span begin="03:35.933" end="03:36.662" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">brave</span><span begin="03:36.662" end="03:41.158" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shine</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">藏在左手的愿望 始终只是愿望</text><text for="L2">我梦见一场不会醒来的幻梦</text><text for="L3">右手握着空白的记忆 无人知晓的世界尽头</text><text for="L4">被不肯停歇的雨拍打</text><text for="L5">守护想守护之物的坚强</text><text for="L6">无法相信这份坚强的软弱</text><text for="L7">接受一切 去寻找明天</text><text for="L8">勇敢之光 只要伸出手仍能触及</text><text for="L9">留下来吧 在这遍体鳞伤的夜里</text><text for="L10">你拯救我生命 把思念交叠在举起的刃尖</text><text for="L11">祈愿穿越时间</text><text for="L12">你的勇敢之光</text><text for="L13">忘了如何发光的蔚蓝星球 留下了</text><text for="L14">望着那不会消失的影子</text><text for="L15">擦肩而过的红色轨迹 仍是懵懂无知的孩子</text><text for="L16">在不会天明的夜里彷徨</text><text for="L17">失去不可失去之物的软弱</text><text for="L18">变得什么都无法相信的脆弱</text><text for="L19">哪怕再也站不起来 命运仍会前进</text><text for="L20">崩溃坠落的星座 在互相伤害的夜里</text><text for="L21">你正划破黎明 在交换过的誓言里</text><text for="L22">连同支撑孤独的坚定梦想一并寄托</text><text for="L23">若真能守护想守护的一切</text><text for="L24">接受一切 去寻找明天</text><text for="L25">点亮黎明</text><text for="L26">勇敢之光 只要伸出手仍能触及</text><text for="L27">留下来吧 在这遍体鳞伤的夜里</text><text for="L28">你拯救我生命 在重叠泪水的尽头找到光</text><text for="L29">祈愿穿越时间</text><text for="L30">我的勇敢之光</text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">My wish remained the same, hidden in my left hand</text><text for="L2">I was dreaming a never-ending dream</text><text for="L3">An empty memory in my right hand, at the end of the unknown world</text><text for="L4">I was standing in the ceaseless rain</text><text for="L5">The strength to protect what I want to protect</text><text for="L6">The weakness of no longer believing in it</text><text for="L7">Accepting them all, search for tomorrow</text><text for="L8">Brave shine, if I reach out, yet</text><text for="L9">Stay the night, the night full of wounds</text><text for="L10">You save my life, the feelings repeated, reaching beyond the blade I held up</text><text for="L11">A prayer travels through time</text><text for="L13">A blue star that forgot how to shine</text><text for="L14">I was watching an unfading shadow of it</text><text for="L15">Red orbits passing each other, as an ignorant child</text><text for="L16">I was wandering in the endless night</text><text for="L17">The weakness of losing what can't be lost</text><text for="L18">The vulnerability of no longer believing in anything</text><text for="L19">Even if I can't stand up, destiny moves forward</text><text for="L20">Break down, constellations are crumbling and damaging one another in the night</text><text for="L21">You're breaking dawn, in the exchanged words</text><text for="L22">Adding a certain dream that supported my loneliness</text><text for="L23">If I can protect what I want to protect</text><text for="L24">Accept everything and search for tomorrow</text><text for="L25">Light up the dawn</text><text for="L26">Brave shine, if I reach out, yet</text><text for="L27">Stay the night, the night full of wounds</text><text for="L28">You save my life, I found a light at the end of my tears</text><text for="L29">A prayer travels through time</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:41.158"><div begin="00:16.628" end="00:55.376" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:16.628" end="00:22.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:16.628" end="00:17.476">左手</span><span begin="00:17.476" end="00:17.859">に</span><span begin="00:17.859" end="00:18.505">隠</span><span begin="00:18.505" end="00:18.741">し</span><span begin="00:18.741" end="00:19.285">た </span><span begin="00:19.409" end="00:20.259">願いは</span><span begin="00:20.259" end="00:21.710">願いの</span><span begin="00:21.710" end="00:22.380">まま</span><span begin="00:22.380" end="00:22.518">で</span></p><p begin="00:22.528" end="00:27.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:22.528" end="00:23.535">覚めない</span><span begin="00:23.646" end="00:24.893">幻(ゆめ)</span><span begin="00:25.044" end="00:25.216">見</span><span begin="00:25.216" end="00:25.823">て</span><span begin="00:25.823" end="00:27.243">た</span></p><p begin="00:27.728" end="00:33.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:27.728" end="00:28.450">右手</span><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.778">には</span><span begin="00:28.778" end="00:29.511">空</span><span begin="00:29.511" end="00:29.894">の</span><span begin="00:29.894" end="00:30.496">記憶 </span><span begin="00:30.709" end="00:31.187">誰も</span><span begin="00:31.187" end="00:31.919">しらない</span><span begin="00:31.919" end="00:32.948">世界</span><span begin="00:32.948" end="00:33.265">の</span><span begin="00:33.265" end="00:33.656">果</span><span begin="00:33.656" end="00:33.797">て</span></p><p begin="00:33.806" end="00:39.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:33.806" end="00:34.174">やま</span><span begin="00:34.174" end="00:34.778">ない</span><span begin="00:34.913" end="00:35.423">雨</span><span begin="00:35.423" end="00:36.148">に</span><span begin="00:36.256" end="00:36.435">う</span><span begin="00:36.435" end="00:37.549">たれて</span><span begin="00:37.549" end="00:37.873">い</span><span begin="00:37.873" end="00:39.687">た</span></p><p begin="00:40.436" end="00:45.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:40.436" end="00:41.026">守り</span><span begin="00:41.026" end="00:41.723">たい</span><span begin="00:41.723" end="00:42.449">もの</span><span begin="00:42.449" end="00:43.122">を</span><span begin="00:43.267" end="00:43.954">守れる</span><span begin="00:43.954" end="00:44.532">強</span><span begin="00:44.532" end="00:45.448">さ</span></p><p begin="00:45.858" end="00:50.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:45.858" end="00:46.436">それを</span><span begin="00:46.436" end="00:47.266">信じら</span><span begin="00:47.357" end="00:48.347">れなく</span><span begin="00:48.347" end="00:48.906">なる</span><span begin="00:48.906" end="00:49.591">弱</span><span begin="00:49.591" end="00:50.222">さ</span></p><p begin="00:50.300" end="00:55.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:50.300" end="00:51.001">すべてを</span><span begin="00:51.001" end="00:51.933">受け入れ</span><span begin="00:51.933" end="00:52.784">て </span><span begin="00:53.070" end="00:53.820">未来(あした)</span><span begin="00:53.820" end="00:54.037">を</span><span begin="00:54.037" end="00:55.376">探す</span></p></div><div begin="00:55.521" end="01:28.906" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="00:55.521" end="01:00.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:55.521" end="00:56.244">Brave </span><span begin="00:56.244" end="00:58.220">shine </span><span begin="00:58.397" end="00:58.918">手を</span><span begin="00:58.918" end="00:59.457">伸</span><span begin="00:59.457" end="01:00.310">ばせば</span><span begin="01:00.310" end="01:00.740">ま</span><span begin="01:00.740" end="01:00.866">だ</span></p><p begin="01:00.876" end="01:06.315" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:00.876" end="01:01.388">Stay </span><span begin="01:01.388" end="01:01.655">the </span><span begin="01:01.655" end="01:03.937">night </span><span begin="01:03.937" end="01:05.606">傷だらけ</span><span begin="01:05.606" end="01:05.838">の</span><span begin="01:05.838" end="01:06.315">夜</span></p><p begin="01:06.326" end="01:15.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:06.326" end="01:06.573">You </span><span begin="01:06.573" end="01:06.974">save </span><span begin="01:06.974" end="01:07.308">my </span><span begin="01:07.308" end="01:09.263">life </span><span begin="01:09.511" end="01:10.825">かざした</span><span begin="01:10.825" end="01:11.608">刃</span><span begin="01:11.608" end="01:12.092">の</span><span begin="01:12.092" end="01:12.627">先</span><span begin="01:12.627" end="01:12.924">に</span><span begin="01:13.006" end="01:14.158">想いを</span><span begin="01:14.158" end="01:15.060">重ね</span><span begin="01:15.060" end="01:15.692">た</span></p><p begin="01:15.867" end="01:23.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:15.867" end="01:16.818">祈りは</span><span begin="01:16.818" end="01:18.022">時</span><span begin="01:18.022" end="01:18.397">を</span><span begin="01:18.397" end="01:19.083">超え</span><span begin="01:19.083" end="01:23.108">て</span></p><p begin="01:23.443" end="01:28.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:23.443" end="01:23.990">Your </span><span begin="01:23.990" end="01:24.675">brave </span><span begin="01:24.675" end="01:28.906">shine</span></p></div><div begin="01:29.506" end="02:08.411" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="01:29.506" end="01:35.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:29.506" end="01:30.193">光る</span><span begin="01:30.193" end="01:30.507">こ</span><span begin="01:30.507" end="01:30.974">と</span><span begin="01:30.974" end="01:31.716">忘れ</span><span begin="01:31.716" end="01:32.302">た </span><span begin="01:32.419" end="01:32.947">青い</span><span begin="01:32.947" end="01:33.946">星が</span><span begin="01:33.946" end="01:35.383">残して</span><span begin="01:35.383" end="01:35.488">く</span></p><p begin="01:35.497" end="01:40.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:35.497" end="01:36.538">消えない</span><span begin="01:36.664" end="01:37.943">影</span><span begin="01:38.067" end="01:38.834">見て</span><span begin="01:38.834" end="01:40.308">た</span></p><p begin="01:40.701" end="01:46.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:40.701" end="01:41.699">すれ違う</span><span begin="01:41.699" end="01:42.433">赤</span><span begin="01:42.433" end="01:42.782">の</span><span begin="01: